---
description: OpenAthlete – Shared Types & Validation Source of Truth
globs:
  - "libs/shared/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Add DTO schemas with Zod and export both schema and inferred type:
  - `export const myDtoSchema = z.object({...})`
  - `export type MyDto = z.infer<typeof myDtoSchema>`
  - Re-export from `libs/shared/src/index.ts` via `./types`.

- Do not redefine domain types in apps. Import from `@openathlete/shared`.

- Prefer discriminated unions and exact shapes. Keep schemas narrow; no `any`.
